  <!--
    Remove all Qualcomm projects (hardware/qcom, hardware/qcom-caf,
    vendor/qcom) from the resolved manifest.
    Generated 2026-11-15 from repo manifest of los-tv-23 (1219 projects).
    The resolved manifest has 94 Qualcomm project paths but only 42 unique
    repo names: LineageOS checks the same qcom repo out at multiple CAF
    paths (msm8953/msm8998/sdm660/.../sm8750).  repo removes every path
    whose project name matches, so one entry per unique name is enough.
    Apply in a clean tree *before* repo sync:
      cp manifest/05-remove-qcom.xml <tree>/.repo/local_manifests/
      repo sync -j8

    23.2-specific: regenerate the list for LineageOS 24.0, where qcom
    names/paths may change.
